WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.200
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an American superhero comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:16.240
called “Zoom”. Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.240
Thirty years ago, a team of five superheroes&nbsp;
called the Zenith fought interstellar criminals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:27.760
and saved the earth. The team leader was a&nbsp;
superhero named Zoom. He was an ordinary man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.480
before being recruited by the US government&nbsp;
for a special program. He had the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:37.680
to run faster than flash. The team also&nbsp;
consisted of Zoom’s elder brother Concussion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.040
who was just as good as him. When the earth was&nbsp;
at risk of being invaded, the American military,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:48.080
led by General Larraby, sought to enhance&nbsp;
the team's powers using an experimental form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:52.720
of radiation called "Gamma-13". 
The group was blasted with the ray&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:59.840
which made Zoom faster and stronger but created a&nbsp;
psychotic break in Concussion. It made him angry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:04.240
unreasonable, and evil. Believing&nbsp;
that Zoom and the team betrayed him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:09.920
Concussion killed three of his teammates. In&nbsp;
the end, Zoom defeated him and threw him into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:16.080
an interdimensional portal to never return.&nbsp;
However, over the years after that, Zoom lost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:21.760
his powers slowly and returned to his old life&nbsp;
as Jack, a mechanic living in California. 
&nbsp;

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:28.080
Now, after thirty years, a scientist on the Zenith&nbsp;
Project, Dr. Grant finds out that Concussion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:34.640
who had entered a dimensional rift, is on a return&nbsp;
trajectory. He has not died or aged because of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:39.920
speed through space-time. The scientists have all&nbsp;
the reasons to believe that he is just as powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:46.080
and is returning to take revenge on his brother.&nbsp;
However, Zoom has become accustomed to his life as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:52.240
Jack and has long lost his powers. Because of&nbsp;
this, General Larraby wants to recruit children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:57.440
with special powers and train them to fight&nbsp;
Concussion when he returns. However, they only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:03.200
have twelve days to do so before his arrival. 
The only person fit to train the special children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:08.640
is Zoom himself. The General is sure that he will&nbsp;
not cooperate, so he orders Grant to bring him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:14.320
the base one way or the other. Then, we see the&nbsp;
former superhero Captain Zoom for the first time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:19.840
After being retired, he is known as Jack.&nbsp;
He uses whatever power he has left to froth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.240
his coffee with his fingers. Grant and&nbsp;
a psychologist on the Zenith Project,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:30.080
Dr. Marsha come to recruit Jack for the mission.&nbsp;
Jack thinks the idea is crazy because they do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.400
need another set of superheroes. Sensing that&nbsp;
he doesn’t want to be a part of the mission,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:39.360
Grant shoots him with a tranquilizer gun and&nbsp;
knocks him out. The General and Grant have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:44.080
decided to keep the return of Concussion a secret&nbsp;
from Jack because they believe it will make him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:49.440
emotional and fog his critical thinking. 
Then, we are introduced to the youngest member&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:54.240
of the team of superheroes who are yet to be&nbsp;
recruited. She is a six-year-old girl named&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.240 --> 00:03:01.040
Cindy who has superhuman strength. She can pick up&nbsp;
and throw a grown person with no effort. Cindy has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:05.840
been using her power to fight bullies but now&nbsp;
wants to audition to be in the superhero team.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:11.360
Next, is a sixteen years old highschooler named&nbsp;
Summer. She has the power of psychokinesis and can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:17.120
move a person or an object using just her mind.&nbsp;
She can also read people’s minds to some extent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:21.360
Because Summer is always alone at school,&nbsp;
she is considered an outcast by many.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:25.200
Hence, to try to fit in, she wants to&nbsp;
audition for the superhero team. 
&nbsp;

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:30.560
Then, there is seventeen-year-old Dylan who can&nbsp;
be invisible at his will. He uses the power to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:36.240
outsmart his teachers but always gets in trouble.&nbsp;
Lastly, twelve-year-old Tucker has the most unique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:42.400
power. He can blow up the size of any part of his&nbsp;
body and make himself giant. In the training base,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:47.760
Jack gains consciousness and is told that he will&nbsp;
get half a million dollars if he accepts to train&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:52.800
the newbies but if he declines, he will be&nbsp;
sent to prison under a false accusation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:57.920
Jack accepts the offer but he still insists that&nbsp;
the world doesn’t need superheroes anymore.
&nbsp;

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:03.680
Following that, he officially meets Dr. Marsha who&nbsp;
is his biggest fan. She collects the first edition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.720
of all of Zenith comics and is obsessed with Zoom.&nbsp;
Jack sees the candidates for the next team of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:13.920
superheroes and is shocked that they are all kids.&nbsp;
He jokes if they are auditioning for the spelling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:18.720
bee but Grant claims that all the kids who are&nbsp;
participating have been given a unique power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:24.000
at birth. According to Dr. Marsha, they will have&nbsp;
to naturally enhance the children’s power because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.480
the risk with Gamma-13 is too high. 
The kids show their special talent;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:33.920
some blink too fast while the others are farting&nbsp;
machines. By the end of the day, Cindy, Summer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:39.600
Dylan, and Tucker are selected to be trained. 
Meanwhile, Concussion will be on earth in nine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:44.800
more days. The General and Grant are delighted&nbsp;
that they were able to recruit the best children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:50.320
in such a short period but they are skeptical&nbsp;
if Jack will be able to train them in time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:54.160
The General is ready to dose the kids&nbsp;
with Gamma-13, without considering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:58.640
the effect it will have on their health. 
At first, the recruited children do not take Jack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:03.920
seriously and think that he is just a random old&nbsp;
dude. But then, Dr. Marsha gives them a lesson on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:09.520
the history of Team Zenith and reveals that Jack&nbsp;
is actually Captain Zoom. The youngest two kids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:15.680
start to look up to him but the oldest Dylan is&nbsp;
still skeptical. The scientists, including Jack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:20.320
check the extent of the children’s powers by&nbsp;
making them use their respective abilities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:24.720
Cindy is always dressed in pretty pink&nbsp;
dresses, even while carrying tons of weight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.960
Jack finds her annoying but the little girl&nbsp;
talks to him every chance she gets. Dylan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:33.520
on the other hand, is the most troublesome&nbsp;
of them all. He disappears while they try to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:39.360
evaluate his powers. The facility develops a new&nbsp;
alert called “code Dylan” just to catch him. 
&nbsp;

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:44.240
One day, after evaluation, Jack asks Dr.&nbsp;
Marsha what they are training the kids for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:49.120
but she dismisses him. The truth is that even&nbsp;
she doesn’t know about Concussion’s return.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:52.880
In a meeting with the General and other&nbsp;
officials from the military, she presents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:57.440
the results of their last few evaluations. It&nbsp;
is revealed that the children are capable of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.640
channeling an unfathomable amount of energy but&nbsp;
currently, they are subconsciously suppressing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:07.840
their full abilities. Jack tries to enter the&nbsp;
meeting but is escorted out by security. 
&nbsp;

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:13.040
The following day, Grant takes the kids&nbsp;
and Jack to a lab where they meet Mr. Pebb,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:18.720
an AI robot that was built to keep team Zenith&nbsp;
company. With Pebb’s help, Jack takes the children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:23.920
to a room where their old space saucer is kept.&nbsp;
He secretly loads the kids up in the flying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:29.440
vehicle and takes them out for a ride. They fly&nbsp;
to Wendy's drive-through and get themselves lunch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:34.000
Everything goes well but the event makes the&nbsp;
news and people start to believe that the earth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:39.440
is being invaded by ice-cream-eating aliens. 
The scientists at the base find out about Jack’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:45.840
little trip but they can take no action against&nbsp;
Captain Zoom himself. That night, Jack is woken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:51.280
up by little Cindy in a rabbit costume. She had&nbsp;
a bad dream and wants to sleep in Jack’s room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:56.160
for the rest of the night. He feels bad for the&nbsp;
little girl and allows her to sleep on the couch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:01.120
bolted to the wall. Cindy thanks him and pulls&nbsp;
the couch out with little to no effort. 
&nbsp;

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:06.080
The following day, the scientists put the kids in&nbsp;
a room filled with hundreds of paintball launchers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:10.960
to train them to dodge bullets. After that, they&nbsp;
train on treadmills and use their powers on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:15.680
one-on-one session with Jack. Although they are&nbsp;
getting better at using their specific strengths,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:21.120
they still have a lot to improve. By the end of&nbsp;
the day, they are covered in paint and bruises and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:26.480
are exhausted. Dylan comments that no one in the&nbsp;
camp cares about them and Jack is only using them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:32.480
for money. When Cindy asks him if that is true,&nbsp;
he neither confirms nor denies the claim. Later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:36.640
Jack goes to meet Dylan in a cell where&nbsp;
he is being kept for trying to escape.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:41.280
He tells Dylan how he was recruited at a young&nbsp;
age and was made to train with his brother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:46.560
Dylan realizes that Concussion, who he knows&nbsp;
from the comics is also a real person and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:51.600
is none other than Jack’s older brother. Jack&nbsp;
is visibly uncomfortable talking about him so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:56.240
he asks Grant to let them both out of the cell.
In the next one-on-one session with Dylan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:01.440
Jack realizes that he may have an additional&nbsp;
special power. He asks Dylan to close his eyes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:07.360
and visualize where Summer is right now. As the&nbsp;
boy focuses, he can see her dancing in her room.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:14.880
It turns out that the power is called mind-sight&nbsp;
and is the rarest power a human being can have.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:19.920
Jack praises Dylan for channeling it at such&nbsp;
a young age and declares him the leader of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:25.840
team. Later, we see Jack and Dr. Marsha together&nbsp;
talking about the training. Jack compliments her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:31.760
hard work, making her blush. She has always liked&nbsp;
and idolized him which he thinks is adorable. 
&nbsp;

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:36.160
In the next scene, Grant and the General&nbsp;
are at the location where the portal to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.880
another dimension lies. They assume that&nbsp;
Concussion is going to emerge in the location&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:45.760
and hence make their soldiers guard the place.&nbsp;
Grant plans to use the kids as a distraction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:51.280
and utilize a sonic net to catch Concussion.&nbsp;
The net will force him to concuss and hence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:56.560
will turn him back to normal in an instant. When&nbsp;
only forty-eight hours are left for his arrival,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:01.760
Jack throws a party for the kids since they have&nbsp;
worked hard the past few days. Dylan and Summer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:07.760
dance together while the others watch them. Soon,&nbsp;
Marsha and Jack also join them. However, their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:12.960
fun is ruined when Grant interrupts and orders&nbsp;
them to shut down the party immediately. 
&nbsp;

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:17.760
Jack sees the soldiers bringing in&nbsp;
equipment for the gamma 13 inducing process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:22.720
He registers that they are about to hurt the&nbsp;
kids like they hurt his team thirty years ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:27.600
He retaliates to the General but the man&nbsp;
is adamant about his decision. At midnight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:32.720
Jack goes to the children’s room and wakes them&nbsp;
up. He plans to secretly make them run away before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:37.600
the General can hurt them. They are brought to&nbsp;
an electric vent which leads to a secret room.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:43.840
There, the kids finally get their superhero&nbsp;
names; Dylan is Mega Boy, Summer is Wonder,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:49.520
Tucker is Houdini, and Cindi is Princess. 
Suddenly, Dylan gets a vision from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:53.120
other room and finds out that the real&nbsp;
mission that officials are working on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:57.680
is to eliminate Concussion when he returns to&nbsp;
the earth. When Jack finds out that his brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:02.720
is alive, he almost doesn’t believe him.
After asking the kids to remain safe, he runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:07.520
to find out the truth. The General confirms&nbsp;
that Concussion is in fact alive and will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:13.200
back in less than two hours. Jack insists that the&nbsp;
kids will never be able to go against Concussion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:19.040
and urges the General to abort the mission. But&nbsp;
he is locked in a cell so the project would run&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:23.920
smoothly. Somewhere else, Marsha has found&nbsp;
the kids and is bringing them to the Grant.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:28.640
On her way, she blows the guards away with&nbsp;
her rainbow breath, revealing that she also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:34.720
has superpowers. Then the group gets Jack out of&nbsp;
the cell and flies away in the space saucer.
&nbsp;

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:40.160
At the same time, the dimensional portal opens&nbsp;
and Concussion is about to land on earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:45.440
The Saucer reaches the location. Jack asks the&nbsp;
kids to stay inside and goes out to meet his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:51.360
brother. They come face to face and almost do not&nbsp;
recognize each other. Concussion hasn’t aged a day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:57.280
since they last met while Jack has turned old and&nbsp;
weak. He tries to calm his evil brother down but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:03.360
Concussion pushes him with an extraordinary force&nbsp;
and sends him flying. Then, the kids, who have now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:08.960
completely turned into Superheroes arrive at the&nbsp;
scene, only to be made fun of by Concussion.
&nbsp;

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.960
When he is distracted, the General launches&nbsp;
the web that is supposed to catch him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:17.920
But Concussion easily diverts its direction&nbsp;
towards Cindy. As she is about to get hit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:22.800
Jack regains his powers and saves her in a&nbsp;
second. Following that, he runs to the lab,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:28.080
puts on his protective gear, and returns to the&nbsp;
location, all in less than five seconds. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:32.400
Zenith team is told that if Concussion is placed&nbsp;
in the middle of the web that was thrown earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:37.280
there is a high chance he will turn back to his&nbsp;
normal self. Dylan uses his power to distract&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:42.960
Concussion while Summer launches several rocks&nbsp;
at him. Then, Tucker, using his bloated stomach&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:48.240
throws him to the air and Cindy hits him&nbsp;
with a pole. At last, Marsha uses her breath&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.080
to push him into the web. Jack, who has now turned&nbsp;
into Zoom, keeps his brother inside the web. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:55.680
only a few seconds, Concussion returns back to&nbsp;
his normal self and stops being aggressive. 
&nbsp;

00:11:55.680 --> 00:12:02.240
Zoom asks Dr. Grant to come with them and forms&nbsp;
a new Zenith team consisting of himself Marsha,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:07.360
Dr. Grant, Concussion, Dylan, Summer,&nbsp;
Tucker, and Cindy. In the last scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:11.920
we see them flying away in a saucer. 
